{"4249940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bad Eye Deer", "steam_appid": 4249940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad Eye Deer is a point and click survival horror game where you survive 3 nights, manage your 'energy' and 'temperature' levels, and keep your <i>own </i>eye out for any incoming threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After accepting a job offer, you find yourself alone in the Artic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Alone with the animals, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it may be night time, but stay awake! It's not just your <i>job </i>on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive The Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 3 nights by <strong>checking for deer</strong> with your <strong>flashlight</strong> and keeping <strong>anomalous deer</strong> out with a <strong>laser barrier</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/5ca1d54f1093b49a5ba5aa395b36a491.poster.avif?t=1769430367\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/5ca1d54f1093b49a5ba5aa395b36a491.webm?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/5ca1d54f1093b49a5ba5aa395b36a491.mp4?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alone in the Arctic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flung into the <strong>Arctic</strong>, use your <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong> to endure the harsh environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/ac376667b10d95cf7c1056ee3e692c2f.poster.avif?t=1769430367\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/ac376667b10d95cf7c1056ee3e692c2f.webm?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/ac376667b10d95cf7c1056ee3e692c2f.mp4?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Energy and Temperature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a <strong>mining</strong> <strong>machine</strong> to keep your <strong>energy</strong> up - needed to operate the <strong>laser barrier</strong>. Make sure to use the <strong>heater</strong> to keep your <strong>temperature</strong> up or risk <strong>freezing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/caec1083e20807f752126ab066abd4d9.poster.avif?t=1769430367\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/caec1083e20807f752126ab066abd4d9.webm?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/caec1083e20807f752126ab066abd4d9.mp4?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Nights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Night (Extra Hard Mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode (Keep going until defeat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bad Eye Deer is a point and click survival horror game where you survive 3 nights, manage your 'energy' and 'temperature' levels, and keep your <i>own </i>eye out for any incoming threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After accepting a job offer, you find yourself alone in the Artic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Alone with the animals, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it may be night time, but stay awake! It's not just your <i>job </i>on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive The Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 3 nights by <strong>checking for deer</strong> with your <strong>flashlight</strong> and keeping <strong>anomalous deer</strong> out with a <strong>laser barrier</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/5ca1d54f1093b49a5ba5aa395b36a491.poster.avif?t=1769430367\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/5ca1d54f1093b49a5ba5aa395b36a491.webm?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/5ca1d54f1093b49a5ba5aa395b36a491.mp4?t=1769430367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alone in the Arctic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flung into the <strong>Arctic</strong>, use your <strong>skills</strong> and <strong>reflexes</strong> to endure the harsh environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249940/extras/ac376667b10d95cf7c1056ee3e692c2f.poster.avif?t=1769430367\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset